      "title": "Writes and Write-Nots",
      "gist": "AI is removing the pressure that once forced everyone to learn to write, and because writing is inseparable from thinking, the coming split between 'writes' and 'write-nots' will also be a split between thinkers and non-thinkers.",
      "sourceHeading": "Writes and Write-Nots"
