      "title": "The Pressure to Write",
      "gist": "Writing is inherently difficult yet demanded by prestigious jobs, and before AI this pressure forced nearly everyone to learn to write or to cheat."
    },
    "n0011": {
      "id": "n0011",
      "depth": 2,
